{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, rounded to two significant figures, the distance between the two objects is\n$(\\,2.1\\times {10}^{4}\\,)\\,\\text{m}.$" 13194139535000 true] [17592186325786 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325787 13194139535000 true] [17592186325786 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325788 13194139535000 true] [17592186325786 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535000 true] [17592186325786 1041 "field-1" 13194139535000 true] [17592186325786 1104 #edb/ref 17592186325788 13194139535000 true] [17592186325786 1110 #uuid "5403e1b5-4c7c-512f-a256-263fef324d87" 13194139535000 true] [17592186325787 1034 "2.0" 13194139535000 true] [17592186325787 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535000 true] [17592186325787 1111 #uuid "984a3d90-a1af-5611-85f2-61cfd6c6a0d4" 13194139535000 true] [17592186325788 1034 "2.1" 13194139535000 true] [17592186325788 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535000 true] [17592186325788 1111 #uuid "b6fe00f5-52c3-55ee-a638-bafc7a5c4ec9" 13194139535000 true] [17592186325789 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325790 13194139535000 true] [17592186325789 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535000 true] [17592186325789 1041 "field-2" 13194139535000 true] [17592186325789 1104 #edb/ref 17592186325790 13194139535000 true] [17592186325789 1110 #uuid "8fda78b0-f98b-52e1-be9b-5d3c9af32ad2" 13194139535000 true] [17592186325790 1034 "10^{4}" 13194139535000 true] [17592186325790 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535000 true] [17592186325790 1111 #uuid "a7492222-4751-5959-8b61-b6194b874b40" 13194139535000 true] [17592186325791 1017 #edb/ref 17592186325792 13194139535000 true] [17592186325791 1017 #edb/ref 17592186325794 13194139535000 true] [17592186325791 1089 "q-336306" 13194139535000 true] [17592186325791 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535000 true] [17592186325791 1100 "Earth has a mass of $(5.97\\times {10}^{24})\\,\\text{kg}$ and Saturn has a mass of $(5.68\\times {10}^{26})\\,\\text{kg}.$ The magnitude of the gravitational force between them is $(1.38\\times {10}^{1